    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30327" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγ-κλύζω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ύσω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rinse the
				inside of</i> a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴνῳ</span>
			with wine, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.91
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>soak</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				5.75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>treat by clysters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					4.154
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, <i>to be administered as a clyster</i> or
				<i>injection</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.197
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
